   "texto": [
    "To ask the place of residence you say «Waar woon je?». In the affirmative answer the verb goes in second position: «Ik woon in Utrecht». To ask the address: «Wat is je adres?». See the nouns with article: «de straat» (street), «de stad» (city), «het dorp» (town). In Dutch the order of direction usually first puts the street and then the number: Marktstraat 12."
